{"id":"2026-07-08-12","date":"2026-07-08","published_at":"2026-07-07T19:33:53.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","title":"Meta Superintelligence Labs 推出 Muse Image 和 Muse Video","original_url":"https://x.com/AIatMeta/status/2074577662840832382","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrb2mxmc0072ihl1mx0aw1bz","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"X：AI at Meta (@AIatMeta)","source_type":"x_post","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; non-AIhot supplements added separately from official/GitHub primary sources.","original_format":"ai-models","aihot_id":"cmrb2mxmc0072ihl1mx0aw1bz","aihot_summary":"Meta Superintelligence Labs 发布首个媒体生成模型 Muse Image 和 Muse Video。Muse Image 是目前最先进的图像生成模型，能精确遵循指令、精准编辑、多参考构图，并利用 Instagram 社交上下文。它还具备智能体工具使用能力并集成 Muse Spark。用户可通过 Meta AI 应用、网页、Instagram Stories 和 WhatsApp 试用，初始限于部分国家。Muse Video 基于相同预训练基础，实现高视觉保真度并原生支持音频。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"媒体生成模型发布可留档，但对今日实践价值有限。","display_summary":"Meta Superintelligence Labs 发布首个媒体生成模型 Muse Image 和 Muse Video。Muse Image 是目前最先进的图像生成模型，能精确遵循指令、精准编辑、多参考构图，并利用 Instagram 社交上下文。它还具备智能体工具使用能力并集成 Muse Spark。用户可通过 Meta AI 应用、网页、Instagram Stories 和 WhatsApp 试用，初始限于部分国家。Muse Video 基于相同预训练基础，实现高视觉保真度并原生支持音频。","summary":"Meta Superintelligence Labs 发布首个媒体生成模型 Muse Image 和 Muse Video。Muse Image 是目前最先进的图像生成模型，能精确遵循指令、精准编辑、多参考构图，并利用 Instagram 社交上下文。它还具备智能体工具使用能力并集成 Muse Spark。用户可通过 Meta AI 应用、网页、Instagram Stories 和 WhatsApp 试用，初始限于部分国家。Muse Video 基于相同预训练基础，实现高视觉保真度并原生支持音频。","why_it_matters":"媒体生成模型发布可留档，但对今日实践价值有限。","priority":"P2","confidence":"low","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"archive","candidate_pool":"archive","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"archive","canonical_key":"https-x-com-aiatmeta-status-2074577662840832382","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_