{"id":"2026-07-08-13","date":"2026-07-08","published_at":"2026-07-07T18:35:58.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","title":"微软为降成本在Copilot中用自研MAI模型替换OpenAI和Anthropic模型","original_url":"https://the-decoder.com/copilot-goes-cheap-as-microsoft-phases-out-openai-and-anthropic-models-to-cut-costs","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrb0u6pv02qtihogovduu795","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; non-AIhot supplements added separately from official/GitHub primary sources.","original_format":"industry","aihot_id":"cmrb0u6pv02qtihogovduu795","aihot_summary":"微软正用自研MAI模型替换Copilot产品中的OpenAI和Anthropic模型以降低支出。MAI模型已在Excel和Outlook中每周处理数万次请求，但占比仍小。Build大会上发布推理模型MAI-Thinking 1，声称编码媲美Sonnet 4.6和Opus 4.6，但基准测试大幅落后，仅与DeepSeek V3.2相当。AI负责人承认目标是削减并消除对Anthropic的支出。CEO暗示未来可能按用量计费，MAI为默认，第三方模型付费附加。微软称MAI使用干净商业许可数据，实际基于Common Crawl。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"企业 Copilot 成本与模型路由是 2B AI 产品的重要商业信号。","display_summary":"微软正用自研MAI模型替换Copilot产品中的OpenAI和Anthropic模型以降低支出。MAI模型已在Excel和Outlook中每周处理数万次请求，但占比仍小。Build大会上发布推理模型MAI-Thinking 1，声称编码媲美Sonnet 4.6和Opus 4.6，但基准测试大幅落后，仅与DeepSeek V3.2相当。AI负责人承认目标是削减并消除对Anthropic的支出。CEO暗示未来可能按用量计费，MAI为默认，第三方模型付费附加。微软称MAI使用干净商业许可数据，实际基于Common Crawl。","summary":"微软正用自研MAI模型替换Copilot产品中的OpenAI和Anthropic模型以降低支出。MAI模型已在Excel和Outlook中每周处理数万次请求，但占比仍小。Build大会上发布推理模型MAI-Thinking 1，声称编码媲美Sonnet 4.6和Opus 4.6，但基准测试大幅落后，仅与DeepSeek V3.2相当。AI负责人承认目标是削减并消除对Anthropic的支出。CEO暗示未来可能按用量计费，MAI为默认，第三方模型付费附加。微软称MAI使用干净商业许可数据，实际基于Common Crawl。","why_it_matters":"企业 Copilot 成本与模型路由是 2B AI 产品的重要商业信号。","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"https-the-decoder-c