{"id":"2026-07-08-16","date":"2026-07-08","published_at":"2026-07-07T16:50:50.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","title":"Liquid AI 开源 Antidoom：基于最终 Token 偏好优化的推理模型死循环修复方法","original_url":"https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/07/07/liquid-ai-antidoom-doom-loops-ftpo","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmraw21y401jhihog3tcrfsp4","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"MarkTechPost（RSS）","source_type":"personal_blog","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; non-AIhot supplements added separately from official/GitHub primary sources.","original_format":"tip","aihot_id":"cmraw21y401jhihog3tcrfsp4","aihot_summary":"Liquid AI 开源了 Antidoom，一种基于 Final Token Preference Optimization （FTPO） 的针对性修复方法，用于减少推理模型中的 doom loop（死循环）问题。该方法定位循环开始的第一个 token，训练模型选择连贯替代项，而不改变整体输出分布。在 LFM2.5-2.6B 上，硬数学和编程任务中的循环率从 10.2% 降至 1.4%；Qwen3.5-4B 上从 22.9% 降至 1%。整套流程可在数小时内完成，全部代码和数据集（LiquidAI/antidoom-mix-v1.0）已开源。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"推理模型死循环修复方法适合进入论文/方法候选。","display_summary":"Liquid AI 开源了 Antidoom，一种基于 Final Token Preference Optimization （FTPO） 的针对性修复方法，用于减少推理模型中的 doom loop（死循环）问题。该方法定位循环开始的第一个 token，训练模型选择连贯替代项，而不改变整体输出分布。在 LFM2.5-2.6B 上，硬数学和编程任务中的循环率从 10.2% 降至 1.4%；Qwen3.5-4B 上从 22.9% 降至 1%。整套流程可在数小时内完成，全部代码和数据集（LiquidAI/antidoom-mix-v1.0）已开源。","summary":"Liquid AI 开源了 Antidoom，一种基于 Final Token Preference Optimization （FTPO） 的针对性修复方法，用于减少推理模型中的 doom loop（死循环）问题。该方法定位循环开始的第一个 token，训练模型选择连贯替代项，而不改变整体输出分布。在 LFM2.5-2.6B 上，硬数学和编程任务中的循环率从 10.2% 降至 1.4%；Qwen3.5-4B 上从 22.9% 降至 1%。整套流程可在数小时内完成，全部代码和数据集（LiquidAI/antidoom-mix-v1.0）已开源。","why_it_matters":"推理模型死循环修复方法适合进入论文/方法候选。","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"paper_candidate","candidate_pool":"paper_candidate","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"paper_candidate","canonical_key":"https-www-marktechpost-com-2026-07-07-liquid-ai-antidoom-doom-loops-ftpo","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"推理模型死循环修复方法适合进入论文/方法候选。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","url_status":"reachable","url_checked_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","requires_manual_review":true,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","tags":[],"interview_relevance":"high","target_role_signal":"","proof_artifact":"","validation_window":"1-3 days","interview_story_angle":"","next_proof_action":""}
