{"id":"2026-07-10-11","date":"2026-07-10","published_at":"2026-07-09T21:46:17.901Z","observed_at":"2026-07-10T03:56:26Z","title":"Cognition 推出 SWE-1.7，接近 GPT 5.5 与 Opus 智能水平","original_url":"https://cognition.com/blog/swe-1-7","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmre2mjao00nrihwkhnv9ahqj","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","source_type":"official_blog","source_tier":"Tier 1","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","original_format":"official_blog","aihot_id":"cmre2mjao00nrihwkhnv9ahqj","aihot_summary":"Cognition 发布迄今最强模型 SWE-1.7，基于 Kimi K2.7 基座训练，通过强化学习管线改进（基础设施、训练稳定性、数据质量、长程任务技术）实现前沿智能水平并大幅降低成本。在 FrontierCode 1.1 Main 基准上达 42.3%（Kimi K2.7 Code 为 30.1%，GPT-5.5 为 43.0%，Opus 4.8 为 46.5%），Terminal-Bench 2.1 达 81.5%，SWE-Bench Multilingual 达 77.8%。模型针对长周期异步任务优化，现已在 Devin（Web、桌面、CLI）通过 Cerebras 以 1000 TPS 提供。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"Coding-agent benchmark and cost claims need primary benchmark review.","display_summary":"Cognition 发布迄今最强模型 SWE-1.7，基于 Kimi K2.7 基座训练，通过强化学习管线改进（基础设施、训练稳定性、数据质量、长程任务技术）实现前沿智能水平并大幅降低成本。在 FrontierCode 1.1 Main 基准上达 42.3%（Kimi K2.7 Code 为 30.1%，GPT-5.5 为 43.0%，Opus 4.8 为 46.5%），Terminal-Bench 2.1 达 81.5%，SWE-Bench Multilingual 达 77.8%。模型针对长周期异步任务优化，现已在 Devin（Web、桌面、CLI）通过 Cerebras 以 1000 TPS 提供。","summary":"Cognition 发布迄今最强模型 SWE-1.7，基于 Kimi K2.7 基座训练，通过强化学习管线改进（基础设施、训练稳定性、数据质量、长程任务技术）实现前沿智能水平并大幅降低成本。在 FrontierCode 1.1 Main 基准上达 42.3%（Kimi K2.7 Code 为 30.1%，GPT-5.5 为 43.0%，Opus 4.8 为 46.5%），Terminal-Bench 2.1 达 81.5%，SWE-Bench Multilingual 达 77.8%。模型针对长周期异步任务优化，现已在 Devin（Web、桌面、CLI）通过 Cerebras 以 1000 TPS 提供。","why_it_matters":"Coding-agent benchmark and cost claims need primary benchmark review.","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_k