{"id":"2026-07-11-08","date":"2026-07-11","published_at":"2026-07-10T09:59:00.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-11T09:27:49+08:00","title":"小红书发布大模型新架构 PIPO","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1eo7rrCAH-OA0TnXwwqJEg","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrerlfrs0046ihm87smc2el4","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"公众号：小红书技术（dots.llm）","source_type":"paper","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; supplemental raw mapped separately when available.","original_format":"paper","aihot_id":"cmrerlfrs0046ihm87smc2el4","aihot_summary":"小红书提出 PIPO 架构，通过输入侧压缩器将两个 token 折叠为一个 latent，输出侧 MTP head 将隐藏状态展开为额外 token，实现输入长度减半、每步输出翻倍。基于 Qwen3.5-4B/9B backbone，在 AIME 2025 等基准上最高带来 +7.15 pass@4 提升。部署测评中，TTFT 加速约 1.23×，TPOT 加速约 1.86×。训练采用 SFT 和 On-Policy Distillation 两阶段，将 verifier 校验能力蒸馏进轻量 confidence head。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"小红书 PIPO 架构可作为中文大模型系统设计补充候选。","display_summary":"小红书提出 PIPO 架构，通过输入侧压缩器将两个 token 折叠为一个 latent，输出侧 MTP head 将隐藏状态展开为额外 token，实现输入长度减半、每步输出翻倍。基于 Qwen3.5-4B/9B backbone，在 AIME 2025 等基准上最高带来 +7.15 pass@4 提升。部署测评中，TTFT 加速约 1.23×，TPOT 加速约 1.86×。训练采用 SFT 和 On-Policy Distillation 两阶段，将 verifier 校验能力蒸馏进轻量 confidence head。","summary":"小红书提出 PIPO 架构，通过输入侧压缩器将两个 token 折叠为一个 latent，输出侧 MTP head 将隐藏状态展开为额外 token，实现输入长度减半、每步输出翻倍。基于 Qwen3.5-4B/9B backbone，在 AIME 2025 等基准上最高带来 +7.15 pass@4 提升。部署测评中，TTFT 加速约 1.23×，TPOT 加速约 1.86×。训练采用 SFT 和 On-Policy Distillation 两阶段，将 verifier 校验能力蒸馏进轻量 confidence head。","why_it_matters":"小红书 PIPO 架构可作为中文大模型系统设计补充候选。","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"paper_candidate","candidate_pool":"paper_candidate","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"paper_candidate","canonical_key":"mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1eo7rrcah-oa0tnxwwqjeg","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":""